  "statement": "theorem dyadic_meanPredict_obstruction : NoRegret (Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) (fun t x => (x - dyadicObservation t)^2) (meanPredict dyadicObservation) ∧ Tendsto (fun T : ℕ => squaredBestRegret dyadicObservation (meanPredict dyadicObservation) T / (T : ℝ)) atTop (nhds (0 : ℝ)) ∧ (¬ ∃ a : ℝ, Tendsto (fun T : ℕ => comparatorRegret (fun t x => (x - dyadicObservation t)^2) (meanPredict dyadicObservation) 0 T / (T : ℝ)) atTop (nhds a)) ∧ ¬ LimitNoRegret (Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) (fun t x => (x - dyadicObservation t)^2) (meanPredict dyadicObservation)",
